WEBVTT

00:00:27.023 --> 00:00:30.359
Sci-fi fans will be leaving
comments on this video:

00:00:30.401 --> 00:00:33.071
“The metaverse is not a new idea.”

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:35.990
In fact, as a TED premiere,

00:00:36.032 --> 00:00:40.620
I want to showcase my research
on 30 years of the metaverse,

00:00:40.661 --> 00:00:43.498
from its inception

00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.249
to its current trajectory.

00:00:45.249 --> 00:00:47.960
(Laughter)

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.545
(Applause)

00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:52.673
That's right, the metaverse
is already on fire,

00:00:52.715 --> 00:00:54.926
and we even have not built it yet.

00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:56.385
That's efficiency.

00:00:58.346 --> 00:00:59.764
How can this happen?